## PR checklist

**Catalog & DB**

- [ ] `link-directory` seed **or** catalog JSON entry: site + opportunities (`dofollow`, cost, `auto_launch_*`) — SQL `504_*` **or** `link_directory_catalog_backfill.catalog.json` + backfill when hub-only (TinyLaunch / Fazier pattern)
- [ ] Catalog JSON entry + local/prod backfill when site is hub-only like TinyLaunch (`pnpm backend:db:backfill-link-directory-catalog`)
- [ ] `auto-launch` destination seed (`503+`): rows in `destinationSeeds.ts`; `pnpm sync:auto-launch-destinations`
- [ ] `destination-configs/*.ts` + registry; `pnpm sync:auto-launch-configs`; aggregate migrations

**Extension**

- [ ] `destination-configs` fixtures + `{site}` provider rows + `directoryLaunchRegistry.ts`; content script, `build-extension.mjs`, `manifest.json`
- [ ] `siteLogin` adapter + `detectDirectorySiteLogin.ts`
- [ ] Site-specific media DOM (if any) in `siteMedia/` + `registry.ts`; **no** new site branches in `fillEngine.ts`
- [ ] Handoff opens `start_url`; fill + complete on live site

**Web & assets**

- [ ] Logo SVG + `buildDirectoryAddChannelTiles` + extension `shippedLinkDirectoryLogoSlugs` in `copy-static.mjs` / `verify-extension-dist.mjs` (+ `buildDirectoryAddChannelTiles.test.ts`)
- [ ] Composer / readiness cover required `profilePath`s

**Docs & marketing**

- [ ] `directory-integration/{site}.md`, `extension-ui-patterns.md` updates
- [ ] Landing/README/docs icon rows when channel is public
- [ ] `landingHeroTheme.ts` — `LANDING_HERO_TITLE_HIGHLIGHT_WORDS` includes the platform’s marketing label (match `platformLabel` on the channel page, e.g. `TinyLaunch`, `Fazier`)

**Verification**

- [ ] `pnpm --filter openquok-common test:unit` (includes sync check)
- [ ] Manual smoke per **extension-ui-patterns.md** (update destination count if needed)

## Do not

- Edit aggregated `*_core_structure.sql` or hand-edit `502_*_extension_configs.sql` / inline `$json$` `extension_config`
- Derive free-queue config in SQL with `jsonb_set` — explicit TS fixture
- Register `provider_slug` only in DB without `destination-configs` provider rows + extension manifest/build
- Ship `web/static/icons/link-directory/{slug}.svg` and web `BUNDLED_DIRECTORY_LOGO_SLUGS` without adding the same slug to extension `shippedLinkDirectoryLogoSlugs` (side panel will show initials only)
- Add inline `directoryLaunchProviders` entries in `pageAssist.ts` (registry lives in `destination-configs/`)
- Confuse **site slug** with **provider slug**
- Add `backend/integrations/providers/*` or social composer tiles for directory-only launches
- Add site-specific DOM, hostnames, or upload/read logic to `extension/src/directory/directory-launch/fillEngine.ts` — use `siteMedia/` adapters and field config instead
- Add or extend compare/alternatives competitor tests (e.g. `web/src/lib/content/constants/competitors/submission/*.compareProduct.test.ts`) — use **add-competitors.mdc** instead
